# Layer: vocabulary · TOPAK source: narrative/glossary.md §4
# Of the paper's three API languages, GraphQL SDL is the best glossary carrier: every type and
# field takes a """description""" that tooling renders, and enums name the vocabulary's closed sets.
# (OpenAPI puts the same text in `description:`; protobuf only in comments.)

"""
Lease: one composite credential, granted for one round, with a closed schema of twelve fields.
A capability that is not a field is not carried (ADR-0031 §1).
"""
type Lease {
  "The principal's identity (ADR-0002 A2)."
  principal: ID!
  "The seat held for this round (ADR-0037 §1). A principal holds exactly one seat."
  seat: ID!
  "The Persona digest, attested at grant and renewal (ADR-0016 §6)."
  persona: Digest!
  "The epoch this lease is valid at. Any increment fences it (ADR-0022 §2)."
  epoch: Int!
  "Fence: the Paxos log index at grant. Leases, admits and issuances are ordered by one log (ADR-0031 §2)."
  fence: Int!
  "The rules epoch in force at grant (ADR-0025, ADR-0026)."
  rulesEpoch: Int!
  "The bundle revision this principal is admitted against; a decision counts only from it (ADR-0033 §5)."
  bundle: Digest!
  "Confinement: the profile digest and the attestation rung it was established at (ADR-0031 §3)."
  confinement: Confinement!
  "Alphabet: the action variants this seat may express (ADR-0022 §1)."
  alphabet: [ActionKind!]!
  "The round this lease is granted for. Never reused per seat (ADR-0003)."
  round: Int!
  "Round role: author or voter. Not ordered, so a change of role is a grant, not a renewal (ADR-0022 §7)."
  role: RoundRole!
  "Expiry as a duration on the local monotonic clock, at most T_persona (ADR-0031 §7, A2)."
  ttlMs: Int!
}

"Rung: how belief in the confinement profile was established. Rung 0 is Mediated, always (ADR-0031 §3)."
enum Rung { NONE_DECLARED LAUNCHER_ASSERTED MEASURED_BOOT CONFIDENTIAL_VM }

type Confinement { digest: Digest!, rung: Rung! }

"Build's alphabet (ADR-0022 §1) and Run's (ADR-0040 §1). No name is shared between the domains."
enum ActionKind { Read Draft Invoke Emit Submit Vote Consult Actuate Report }

enum RoundRole { author voter }

"Lowercase hex SHA-256."
scalar Digest
